---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Google Ads management"
  description="Campaign management with ad spend paid separately. Part of Hero Digital growth services, sold after a fit check. AUD ex GST."
  path="/growth-services/google-ads/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Growth services"
    title="Google Ads management"
    lead="Campaign management with ad spend paid separately."
    crumbs={[
      { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
      { href: '/growth-services/', label: 'Growth services' },
      { href: '/growth-services/google-ads/', label: 'Google Ads management' },
    ]}
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Essential is a review and recommendations so you can run ads yourselves if you prefer. Advanced and Authority include management of implant and full-arch search campaigns; Authority adds remarketing and fortnightly optimisation. We do not guarantee leads, and we will not write ads that breach Ahpra rules.</p>
      <p>Every growth-service engagement starts with a <a href="/growth-services/fit-check/">fit check</a>. Prices for the three proposed tiers — Essential $2,495, Advanced $3,995 and Authority $5,995 a month — are on the <a href="/growth-services/">growth services</a> page.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/growth-services/fit-check/">Check if we’re a good fit</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
